autowhisper (0.1.0-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * GPU-accelerated voice-to-text for Ubuntu
  * Unified CLI: autowhisper start/stop/doctor/config/model
  * System diagnostics with autowhisper doctor
  * Model management with autowhisper model list/download
  * Push-to-talk and toggle hotkey modes
  * X11 text injection with clipboard fallback
  * systemd user service integration

